                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "IMO we should try to replicate the real scenario here.\n\nI don't see the problem with the path conflict, the `insert_or_assign` will take care of replacing the existing config.\n\nWhen the gpio is set to low in the testcase, that change should result in the D-Bus interface being created. The config being re-added should not be an issue.\n\nIf the D-Bus interface were not present when the config was re-added we would not be testing the failure scenario described in commit message."
                },
